WEBVTT

00:00:02.780 --> 00:00:07.360
A truly wise man listens to
what others have to say!

00:00:09.060 --> 00:00:11.960
Did our self centered President
really just say that?

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.370
Inconceivable! In a good way!

00:00:15.650 --> 00:00:18.400
Do you have a fever, President?

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:22.610
I guess even she's matured a little.

00:00:22.610 --> 00:00:28.260
Why are you all looking at me like a
mom who's watching a kid grow up?

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:31.740
Do you mean to say that you were
always capable of maturity?

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:33.120
And so...

00:00:33.510 --> 00:00:34.760
You're ignoring me?

00:00:34.760 --> 00:00:36.670
We'll collect the surveys
that'll tell us

00:00:36.670 --> 00:00:38.260
what people
want the council to do!

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:41.210
Surveys?

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.720
When did we hand those out?

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:46.130
Come to think of it,
we've never collected them.

00:00:46.760 --> 00:00:50.170
But we don't have to pick
them up ourselves, do we?

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:53.400
We can just have them
returned to homeroom.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:57.580
I think there are some things we can
learn only by going ourselves.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:00:59.740
Maybe.

00:01:00.170 --> 00:01:05.630
If Mafuyu was asked personally,
I might have a thing or two to say.

00:01:07.070 --> 00:01:09.410
I understand your interest in this,

00:01:09.410 --> 00:01:13.920
but it's impossible for
us to gather them all.

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:15.110
Yeah.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:16.930
Some of the students have gone home.

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.970
We don't have to get them all.

00:01:20.850 --> 00:01:23.540
We just have to get a few of them

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:28.170
so it looks like the student
council is doing something.

00:01:28.670 --> 00:01:30.440
Cold.

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:34.530
And since some of them will probably
ask to change the school rules,

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:37.950
I'd like to change the
school rules, as well.

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.500
Aka-chan,

00:03:17.500 --> 00:03:19.530
even if that's what the students want,

00:03:19.530 --> 00:03:21.320
I don't think we can
change the school rules.

00:03:21.640 --> 00:03:23.420
What are you saying, Chizuru?

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:26.130
Now is the time to rise up!

00:03:26.130 --> 00:03:28.460
That is our destiny!

00:03:29.860 --> 00:03:32.790
The President is talking
like the final boss!

00:03:32.790 --> 00:03:38.200
But people who say that usually
get killed by the hero.

00:03:38.540 --> 00:03:40.280
No, Mafuyu-chan.

00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:46.690
I've got no problem sacrificing
the heroine to create a utopia!

00:03:47.010 --> 00:03:51.600
I'd be willing to sacrifice a student
or two to change the school rules...

00:03:51.600 --> 00:03:55.090
...by throwing rotten tomatoes
at them from the shadows!

00:03:55.090 --> 00:03:56.490
Rotten tomatoes?

00:03:56.750 --> 00:03:58.750
But I don't think anybody's really

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.360
that unhappy with the current rules.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:03.440
There are lots of rules
I'd like to change!

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:04.360
For example?

00:04:04.570 --> 00:04:06.360
For example... This!

00:04:06.730 --> 00:04:09.960
"If you wish to use school facilities for
anything other than schoolwork,

00:04:09.960 --> 00:04:11.840
you must first ask a teacher."

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.370
What part of that
do you take issue with?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:17.610
It means I can't make a secret base.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:19.640
You couldn't make one regardless!

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:21.880
Doesn't every high school
student want to make one?

00:04:22.190 --> 00:04:24.570
Maybe elementary school students...

00:04:24.570 --> 00:04:27.120
Anyway, you don't have to make
one in the school, do you?

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:32.390
I'm too old to want
to make one outside.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:35.380
A high school student wants to make

00:04:35.380 --> 00:04:38.130
herself an elegant,
private room at school.

00:04:38.400 --> 00:04:41.090
Can't you understand
the romance of this?

00:04:41.090 --> 00:04:44.400
You're talking just like a little kid.

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:48.950
So as you can see, the school rules
are tying the students down.

00:04:48.950 --> 00:04:51.640
No, just you!

00:04:52.330 --> 00:04:55.150
Actually, it's more like you're getting
yourself tangled in them!

00:04:55.470 --> 00:04:57.980
Now, everybody else,
give me your suggestions!

00:04:57.980 --> 00:05:00.210
Nobody's gonna have
any suggestions like that.

00:05:00.210 --> 00:05:01.800
Aka-chan's right.

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.700
There are a few things I
think we should change.

00:05:05.940 --> 00:05:07.690
I can think of a few, too.

00:05:07.690 --> 00:05:11.930
Come to think of it,
there are a couple.

00:05:13.030 --> 00:05:16.050
See? Everybody has rules
they want to change.

00:05:16.050 --> 00:05:18.170
Let's start with Minatsu.

00:05:18.910 --> 00:05:20.910
This is the one I don't like.

00:05:21.470 --> 00:05:27.450
"You may not come to school on a
moped, motorized bike, or by car."

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:29.440
That's pretty normal.

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:33.120
There may be some students out there

00:05:33.120 --> 00:05:35.460
who can't come to school without
drifting down a mountain.

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.270
Why would they have to do that?

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:39.090
Nobody needs to drift!

00:05:39.350 --> 00:05:42.600
Don't try to judge everything
by your own standards.

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.830
But your standards are messed up!

00:05:45.090 --> 00:05:46.140
Now, now...

00:05:46.550 --> 00:05:49.180
If we go listen to what the
students have to say,

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:50.840
they'll tell us other rules to change.

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:54.100
We don't want to follow the path
the adults have laid out for us.

00:05:54.100 --> 00:05:56.170
Because we're the student council!

00:05:57.130 --> 00:06:01.110
You sure like those stupid things
you write on the whiteboard.

00:06:02.430 --> 00:06:06.830
So everybody go get your
surveys from your grade.

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:08.340
You're ignoring me?

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.480
I'm the advisor! You can't
treat me like this!

00:06:10.480 --> 00:06:11.750
Let's go.

00:06:11.750 --> 00:06:13.620
I said, don't ignore me!

00:06:14.270 --> 00:06:18.360
Um, is Mafuyu going to have to get
all the first year surveys by herself?

00:06:20.130 --> 00:06:23.130
I'll send Magiru-sensei with you.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.130
Don't treat me like this...

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:27.830
To be honest, she's useless
and I don't need her.

00:06:27.830 --> 00:06:30.740
You're making it worse!

00:06:30.740 --> 00:06:33.100
Mafuyu-chan's got a point,

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:36.010
but she'll balance things out,
so just deal with it.

00:06:37.410 --> 00:06:40.920
I think there's something
wrong with this conversation.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:43.600
Very well.

00:06:43.600 --> 00:06:46.160
To be frank, she'll just be in the way.

00:06:46.610 --> 00:06:48.890
But Mafuyu will take her anyway.

00:06:49.300 --> 00:06:52.660
She should at least be
able to hold the surveys.

00:06:52.970 --> 00:06:55.540
Mafuyu's not so sure.

00:06:55.920 --> 00:06:58.580
Now let's go, Magiru-sensei.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:01.170
I can too hold the surveys.

00:07:01.890 --> 00:07:04.320
Let's go, Aka-chan.

00:07:04.320 --> 00:07:06.070
Okay, Chizuru.

00:07:06.710 --> 00:07:08.190
Okay, Minatsu.

00:07:08.190 --> 00:07:09.990
The two of us are alone,

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.250
so let's do something naughty
in the student council room.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:13.160
Now then...

00:07:13.690 --> 00:07:15.510
Let's get going, Ken.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:16.790
Right.

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.730
What we want the student council to do?

00:07:22.050 --> 00:07:23.980
Or rules you want to change.

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:25.860
Give us anything!

00:07:26.900 --> 00:07:29.370
Then I'd like to go on a date with you!

00:07:30.350 --> 00:07:32.920
So you're saying you
want me to kill you?

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.770
Ch-Chizuru...

00:07:36.230 --> 00:07:37.910
I can't think of anything.

00:07:37.910 --> 00:07:39.030
Me either.

00:07:41.760 --> 00:07:45.850
It might be hard for them to tell
the truth when you're here.

00:07:47.020 --> 00:07:50.600
Change the fragrance used in
the bathroom once in a while.

00:07:51.320 --> 00:07:54.430
Then how about we use
the scent of yakisoba bread?

00:07:57.100 --> 00:07:58.750
Nothing.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:01.330
Even if I did, I don't think the
student council could do it.

00:08:03.950 --> 00:08:05.440
Nobody expects anything of us.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:08.340
I knew that, but they
really shut us down.

00:08:08.510 --> 00:08:11.840
We're the kind of people
it's easy to open up to.

00:08:12.370 --> 00:08:15.480
Well, I like being
friends with everybody.

00:08:15.780 --> 00:08:17.250
Oh, Minatsu.

00:08:17.500 --> 00:08:18.500
Kikuchi!

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:20.600
Thanks for playing in that game.

00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:24.160
Sure, it's been a while since I played basketball.

00:08:28.360 --> 00:08:30.500
And she looks like she's having fun.

00:08:31.760 --> 00:08:32.770
No.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.200
This bothers me.

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:36.190
M-Minatsu.

00:08:37.020 --> 00:08:39.650
I'm going to go get the
surveys from Class D.

00:08:40.030 --> 00:08:41.090
I'll go, too.

00:08:41.090 --> 00:08:43.070
No, take your time.

00:08:43.070 --> 00:08:43.650
See you.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.640
I'm getting jealous over this?

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.120
Oh, were you busy?

00:08:52.410 --> 00:08:53.590
Sorry to bug you.

00:08:53.590 --> 00:08:56.810
No, talking to people is
part of my job today.

00:09:00.450 --> 00:09:03.480
What they say about
you is true, Sugisaki!

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:07.000
What's wrong with remembering
a cute girl's name?

00:09:07.520 --> 00:09:10.130
I'm living true to myself!

00:09:10.400 --> 00:09:12.950
I hope you don't mind!
Nice to meet you!

00:09:13.740 --> 00:09:15.240
Nice to meet you!

00:09:15.680 --> 00:09:16.570
What's with him?

00:09:16.570 --> 00:09:18.570
He's got all those girls
fawning over him.

00:09:21.150 --> 00:09:22.420
Oh, Minatsu.

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:23.470
That was fast.

00:09:23.470 --> 00:09:25.520
You could've taken your time.

00:09:25.890 --> 00:09:27.820
Are you saying
I'm bothering you?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.660
Did you get the surveys yet?

00:09:31.060 --> 00:09:32.570
I'm talking to them now.

00:09:32.920 --> 00:09:35.510
About the requests for the student
council I mentioned...

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.900
Like you being my boyfriend?

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:44.770
I-I think your wife is getting mad.

00:09:45.660 --> 00:09:47.170
Who are you calling his wife?

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.920
H-Hey, Minatsu.

00:09:49.920 --> 00:09:51.910
I'm glad you're jealous,
but hold it in.

00:09:52.130 --> 00:09:54.870
Jealous? Who's jealous?

00:09:54.870 --> 00:09:56.520
Hurry up!

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:57.790
Okay!

00:09:58.220 --> 00:09:59.580
Everybody, give me your surveys.

00:10:01.680 --> 00:10:02.840
What is this?

00:10:03.300 --> 00:10:05.920
Since when am I this short-tempered?

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:08.060
Thanks, everyone.

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:10.240
Stop smiling like
an idiot, Ken.

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.060
Today, your smile...

00:10:12.060 --> 00:10:13.130
Thanks again, guys!

00:10:13.130 --> 00:10:14.800
...really pisses me off!

00:10:15.610 --> 00:10:17.910
You looked like you were having fun.

00:10:17.910 --> 00:10:19.660
They're all good girls.

00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:22.640
I'm glad to hear that.

00:10:22.640 --> 00:10:25.710
But don't forget you're doing your job
for the student council right now.

00:10:26.630 --> 00:10:28.380
I didn't forget!

00:10:28.380 --> 00:10:32.050
You were having fun with
Kikuchi-kun back there, too.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:34.220
We were just catching up!

00:10:34.450 --> 00:10:36.550
Not wasting time.

00:10:36.550 --> 00:10:38.890
I was gathering information, too!

00:10:44.700 --> 00:10:47.480
You get a different reaction
when you go in person.

00:10:47.480 --> 00:10:48.610
Yeah.

00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.700
By the way, are there any
rules you want changed?

00:10:53.260 --> 00:10:56.320
"Do not bring more money to school
than necessary," I guess.

00:10:56.320 --> 00:10:57.210
Why?

00:10:57.670 --> 00:11:00.260
It gets in the way.

00:11:00.260 --> 00:11:01.880
Of my organization.

00:11:02.110 --> 00:11:03.670
Your organization?

00:11:03.670 --> 00:11:07.250
A new plotline for Student
Council's Discretion?

00:11:07.680 --> 00:11:12.890
This rule is hampering the
progress of Project Genocide.

00:11:13.170 --> 00:11:15.970
Your organization has a
big, evil project,

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:18.590
but I guess they're following
the school rules.

00:11:21.270 --> 00:11:22.900
Welcome back, Mafuyu-chan.

00:11:24.260 --> 00:11:25.670
Where's Magiru-sensei?

00:11:26.110 --> 00:11:28.540
She was so useless I left her behind.

00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.240
The surveys!

00:11:36.310 --> 00:11:37.550
I see.

00:11:38.060 --> 00:11:41.290
So how far did she go to pick them up?

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:42.700
Dunno.

00:11:43.690 --> 00:11:44.670
Rules?

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:46.390
Hmm...

00:11:46.970 --> 00:11:50.550
Make a rule that says Shiina has to
come help us once in a while.

00:11:50.980 --> 00:11:52.730
I'd want to have an afro.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:53.530
Seriously?

00:11:54.430 --> 00:11:55.990
You don't like them?

00:11:55.990 --> 00:11:57.550
Never mind.

00:11:57.550 --> 00:11:59.150
Don't hate me!

00:11:59.150 --> 00:11:59.920
Please.

00:11:59.920 --> 00:12:01.140
Oh, right.

00:12:01.430 --> 00:12:03.040
You can have these.

00:12:06.320 --> 00:12:07.360
Tasty!

00:12:08.190 --> 00:12:10.080
Minatsu has sure been meeting

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:13.780
a lot of new people
when I'm not around.

00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:17.690
What is this?

00:12:17.960 --> 00:12:22.570
Seeing this, part of me feels proud...

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.850
But...

00:12:26.950 --> 00:12:28.220
What's wrong, Ken?

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:30.190
Have another.

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.550
No, you can have the rest.

00:12:33.550 --> 00:12:34.600
Yeah?

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.180
Thanks, then.

00:12:37.290 --> 00:12:40.550
If you're mad about
back there, I'm sorry.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.450
Something just set me off.

00:12:42.730 --> 00:12:44.700
No, that's not it.

00:12:44.700 --> 00:12:45.450
Sorry.

00:12:46.140 --> 00:12:47.270
Okay, then.

00:12:48.320 --> 00:12:51.280
Let's hit the indoor clubs next.

00:12:51.280 --> 00:12:51.880
Yeah.

00:12:57.130 --> 00:13:02.330
Does Minatsu just see me as
one of her many guy friends?

00:13:06.060 --> 00:13:10.210
Ken's depressed 'cause I
got in his way, isn't he?

00:13:10.870 --> 00:13:13.210
He works hard to
get girls to like him.

00:13:14.020 --> 00:13:16.650
And it was just about to pay off.

00:13:18.910 --> 00:13:20.540
Why did I do that?

00:13:26.570 --> 00:13:29.280
I'm going to the wind instrument club.

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.630
You can come when you're done eating.

00:13:31.980 --> 00:13:33.470
Oh, thanks.

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:42.160
They want a sushi place in

00:13:42.160 --> 00:13:45.140
the cafeteria and a ferris
wheel in the back.

00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:48.380
What are you writing, Mafuyu-chan?

00:13:48.620 --> 00:13:50.750
The rule I want to change.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:54.150
Mafuyu wants all rules banning
games and comics in school lifted!

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.720
That sounds like something you'd want.

00:13:57.060 --> 00:14:01.190
I think it's not just Mafuyu that
wants this, it's everybody.

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.660
Games and Boys Love.

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:05.400
Don't try to subtly swap
comics with Boys Love.

00:14:05.600 --> 00:14:08.500
But everybody brings them anyway.

00:14:08.500 --> 00:14:11.400
What else do you want?

00:14:11.970 --> 00:14:13.810
I want to start a project to

00:14:13.810 --> 00:14:16.410
turn every student at Hekiyou
Academy into an otaku!

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:19.890
We'll add otaku-related
classes to the curriculum.

00:14:19.890 --> 00:14:23.050
And have otaku-related
problems on the exams.

00:14:24.730 --> 00:14:28.550
And when the students graduate,
what will they go on to be?

00:14:29.030 --> 00:14:30.960
First-rate NEETs!

00:14:31.900 --> 00:14:33.560
Anybody have anything?

00:14:33.820 --> 00:14:36.150
Me! I want Sugisaki-kun
to carry all the stuff

00:14:36.150 --> 00:14:37.930
for the wind ensemble!

00:14:38.170 --> 00:14:39.400
That's a good idea!

00:14:39.400 --> 00:14:40.400
No, it's not!

00:14:42.200 --> 00:14:44.090
You sure have changed, Ken.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.300
How can I be like you?

00:14:48.100 --> 00:14:52.280
Nobody who wants to be like me
belongs in the student council.

00:14:53.860 --> 00:14:56.770
You guys have too many requests!

00:14:58.650 --> 00:15:03.150
He's already got more
friends than I do.

00:15:06.370 --> 00:15:08.770
Who's changed him so dramatically?

00:15:09.640 --> 00:15:10.750
Us?

00:15:11.700 --> 00:15:12.790
If not us,

00:15:12.790 --> 00:15:15.310
was it his family or his
childhood friend

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:17.350
who made him who
he was back then?

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:21.410
What's wrong, Minatsu?

00:15:21.760 --> 00:15:24.700
No, it's nothing.

00:15:25.380 --> 00:15:26.780
It's something!

00:15:27.290 --> 00:15:30.520
I just have this stabbing
pain in my chest.

00:15:31.410 --> 00:15:32.850
That's really bad.

00:15:32.850 --> 00:15:35.050
The nurse's office...
No, an ambulance!

00:15:35.360 --> 00:15:36.560
No, I'm fine.

00:15:37.060 --> 00:15:38.520
I'm fine now.

00:15:38.900 --> 00:15:40.960
You can say you're okay,

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.290
but I'm really worried!

00:15:44.440 --> 00:15:45.300
Huh?

00:15:45.680 --> 00:15:47.040
It's better.

00:15:47.660 --> 00:15:51.320
The cleaning tools are falling
apart, get new ones.

00:15:51.320 --> 00:15:52.650
Sounds good.

00:15:52.650 --> 00:15:55.050
Take some money out of the budget.

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:56.680
Oh no! Magiru-sensei!

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:00.950
What's wrong?

00:16:02.310 --> 00:16:05.200
I can <i>too</i> hold surveys...

00:16:05.910 --> 00:16:07.250
Is she okay?

00:16:07.250 --> 00:16:08.190
Let's hurry.

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:12.130
Mafuyu knew asking Magiru-sensei
was a mistake.

00:16:12.550 --> 00:16:14.400
I said I'm fine.

00:16:14.400 --> 00:16:16.190
Just rest for a bit.

00:16:16.660 --> 00:16:18.200
Is no one else back?

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:19.820
Sit down.

00:16:19.820 --> 00:16:21.370
You want a blanket?

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:22.700
I'm fine.

00:16:22.880 --> 00:16:24.010
You want a lemon?

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.430
Have you bought the baby bed?

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:26.600
Have you decided on a name?

00:16:26.600 --> 00:16:30.720
I said I'm not pregnant!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:33.580
And you're not worried at all, are you?

00:16:35.370 --> 00:16:38.130
You may not realize it,
but the muscles in

00:16:38.130 --> 00:16:40.350
your cheeks are 2%
tenser than normal.

00:16:40.670 --> 00:16:43.200
How much do you know about me?

00:16:43.200 --> 00:16:45.490
I said I'm fine already!

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:47.360
You're sure?

00:16:48.080 --> 00:16:49.470
Really...

00:16:49.470 --> 00:16:52.680
I'm happy you're worried
about me, I guess.

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:55.370
I mean, it's weird 'cause
I'm not used to it.

00:16:55.970 --> 00:16:57.510
Not that I mind.

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:02.060
When she acts that way,
she makes me blush.

00:17:04.770 --> 00:17:08.490
Wh-What were you like before you met us?

00:17:09.170 --> 00:17:10.880
What's that got to do with anything?

00:17:11.580 --> 00:17:13.620
When I saw you today,
I started to wonder.

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:20.890
I guess me, minus a little
bit of the pervertedness.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:22.380
I see.

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:25.300
You've always been social, then.

00:17:25.730 --> 00:17:28.200
My childhood friend was always popular.

00:17:29.150 --> 00:17:32.580
Maybe I just ended up that way
'cause I was with her all the time.

00:17:33.250 --> 00:17:36.390
My tendency to interrupt,
my constant cheerfulness...

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.640
That probably comes from Asuka.

00:17:38.960 --> 00:17:40.330
Her name's Asuka.

00:17:42.660 --> 00:17:44.530
Are you okay, Minatsu?

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:46.650
I'm okay.

00:17:47.370 --> 00:17:50.270
And I don't think I'm sick after all.

00:17:50.730 --> 00:17:52.060
I see. I see.

00:17:52.060 --> 00:17:53.340
So that's it.

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:54.660
So what's it?

00:17:55.090 --> 00:17:58.440
I guess realizing it
makes me feel better.

00:17:58.440 --> 00:18:00.530
A lot better, actually.

00:18:00.890 --> 00:18:02.470
You're acting weird.

00:18:02.470 --> 00:18:04.970
Nothing you're saying makes sense!

00:18:05.660 --> 00:18:07.620
I can't tell with my hand.

00:18:09.760 --> 00:18:10.610
That's strange.

00:18:10.610 --> 00:18:11.720
There's no fever.

00:18:16.980 --> 00:18:20.970
Oh crap, she's going to shout "sexual
harassment" and punch me again.

00:18:22.570 --> 00:18:25.780
I hate to say it,
but this is fun. I'm happy.

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:26.820
I'm happy.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:28.270
She's laughing!

00:18:28.270 --> 00:18:29.470
Something is wrong.

00:18:29.470 --> 00:18:31.200
I think she's possessed!

00:18:36.340 --> 00:18:37.340
Are you blushing?

00:18:37.620 --> 00:18:40.100
In this moment, I'm terrified!

00:18:40.500 --> 00:18:42.840
That's so cute, that part of you.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:44.260
Cute?

00:18:44.260 --> 00:18:46.340
Minatsu called me cute?

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.940
That settles it.

00:18:47.940 --> 00:18:49.870
This isn't Minatsu!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:52.350
Something is controlling her.

00:18:53.390 --> 00:18:54.850
I can see it!

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.280
Hey, Ken...

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.630
Would you mind if I made
sure of my feelings?

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:03.230
She wants to make sure she wants blood?

00:19:03.560 --> 00:19:07.070
Or does she want to eat me?

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:08.110
Ken...

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:11.070
Even if this is how I die,

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:14.570
if I can feel her lips as I go,

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:17.590
then it was a good life.

00:19:18.610 --> 00:19:20.090
Wait, no!

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:23.570
If I'm gonna die, let it be in exchange
for something a little naughtier!

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:26.880
How soft...

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.850
Please be gentle.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:33.940
What?

00:19:33.940 --> 00:19:34.730
Minatsu.

00:19:35.040 --> 00:19:36.410
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:36.410 --> 00:19:38.730
You were just acting so weird.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:42.500
Which of us was being weird, exactly?

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:46.000
But now I really do understand.

00:19:46.890 --> 00:19:49.970
These feelings are something that

00:19:49.970 --> 00:19:52.240
sprang up out of nowhere.

00:19:52.880 --> 00:19:55.300
It seems like she's talking to me,

00:19:55.300 --> 00:19:57.270
but she's really been talking
to herself, hasn't she?

00:19:57.830 --> 00:20:00.250
Is something really possessing her?

00:20:01.410 --> 00:20:04.020
Please save her!

00:20:07.070 --> 00:20:08.760
Everybody's back.

00:20:09.300 --> 00:20:12.170
Now my terrifying encounter
with the demon will end.

00:20:12.170 --> 00:20:13.690
I'm so glad.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.150
Hey, Ken.

00:20:19.960 --> 00:20:23.310
That's enough for me for today.

00:20:24.470 --> 00:20:26.900
She looks a lot better.

00:20:27.850 --> 00:20:30.040
She sucked out my life energy!

00:20:31.200 --> 00:20:32.320
We're back.

00:20:32.840 --> 00:20:35.650
Oh, you two are back.

00:20:36.100 --> 00:20:37.590
Hey, President.

00:20:37.590 --> 00:20:39.920
We got all our surveys.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.060
Oh, let me see.

00:20:41.060 --> 00:20:42.680
No, President!

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:43.660
No, everyone!

00:20:44.140 --> 00:20:46.450
Stay away from Minatsu right now!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.180
Senpai?

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:50.520
Key-kun?

00:20:52.380 --> 00:20:55.980
In that moment, Minatsu's eyes
were strangely kind.

00:20:57.880 --> 00:21:00.400
I'd like to change the school rules,

00:21:00.400 --> 00:21:03.080
but everyone's opinions,
except mine, were kinda lame.

00:21:03.270 --> 00:21:06.690
President, that's my line.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.800
Mafuyu's line.

00:21:09.460 --> 00:21:11.090
My line.

00:21:12.530 --> 00:21:15.830
H-Hey, why isn't Sugisaki doing
his usual gimmick and saying,

00:21:15.830 --> 00:21:19.770
"All the girls have to come
to school in their underwear"?

00:21:19.770 --> 00:21:22.100
I guess I'm just not feeling it.

00:21:22.700 --> 00:21:27.970
Some things are only hot because
the rules forbid them.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:30.490
So I'm happy with things as they are.

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:33.300
You're boring today, Key-kun.

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:36.620
I don't think that's fair.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:39.350
Fine then, I'll suggest something.

00:21:40.490 --> 00:21:43.320
So you want something
that's not perverted.

00:21:43.940 --> 00:21:47.360
Mafuyu wants to hear this!

00:21:48.580 --> 00:21:51.360
Let's see what Key-kun's got.

00:21:51.880 --> 00:21:56.370
If Sugisaki's proposal is good,
we'll discard ours.

00:21:57.430 --> 00:21:59.610
But, um...

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:15.960
The student council has added a
new rule to the school rules.

00:22:16.780 --> 00:22:19.160
Even if it means bending
the rules a bit,

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:20.830
the students of Hekiyou
Academy are required

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:23.170
to have fun every day!

00:23:54.870 --> 00:23:58.390
Do you think everyone would want
us to change this rule, too?

00:23:58.390 --> 00:23:59.170
See?

00:23:59.550 --> 00:24:02.660
"No pets, insects, or
other living creatures."

00:24:03.030 --> 00:24:04.930
Do you have a pet you want to bring?

00:24:05.550 --> 00:24:07.850
There may not be a need to change it.

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:12.940
Aka-chan and Key-kun are
already allowed in school.

00:24:13.310 --> 00:24:15.940
We're your pets?

00:24:16.350 --> 00:24:18.530
Aka-chan is my pet, but...

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:23.580
I'm an insect?

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:28.890
Sugisaki, don't use the desk as a bed.

00:24:28.890 --> 00:24:31.190
Are you dissatisfied with Ringo's body, brother?

00:24:31.190 --> 00:24:32.170
I'm kind of nervous.

00:24:32.170 --> 00:24:33.420
No naughty stuff!

00:24:33.420 --> 00:24:34.510
Next time: Holy War!

00:24:34.510 --> 00:24:35.950
Sugisaki's out of control!

00:24:35.950 --> 00:24:39.230
I think my perverted brother
is still in Japan. Probably.
